(Bug #49: a buffer has a header of its own, so iterating it read that
 header as a list's and walked the buffer's payload as elements - silently,
 with no crash and no flag. Before the fix this compiled and printed
 [6513249, 0, 0]: 6513249 is 0x636261, the bytes "abc" read as a qword.)

